  "onboardingIntroPage1Item0": "Your diary is stored encrypted on this device.",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item1": "No account, no ads, and no behavioral tracking.",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item2": "Protect it with a password or biometrics, and lock automatically after a while away.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Title": "You decide how you write",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item0": "Write plain text, or use Markdown, checklists, photos, and files.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item1": "Want to sort out your thoughts first? Talk with AI, then turn the chat into one diary entry.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item2": "AI receives content only when you ask it to generate or organize, and only to the provider you set up. Nothing is saved until you confirm.",
