  "personalizationTypographyPreviewTitleParagraph1": "A small good thing today: the sunlight landed perfectly on the desk. A moment worth keeping, so I wrote it down first.",
  "personalizationTypographyPreviewBodyParagraph1": "Write down how you feel now and let words keep the memory warm. Write down how you feel now and let words keep the memory warm.",
